TI  - SMC - Investigation about Control of False Positive Rate for Automatic Sperm Detection in Assisted Reproductive Technology
PY  - 2018
AB  - This research aims to realize sperm selection support system for assisted reproductive technology. Sperm detection is one of the important component technology. High detection rate is required even the expense of false positive detections so as not to miss promising sperms as much as possible. False positive rate control is key technology for assure high detection rate and adaptive threshold adjustment methods in boosting is proposed. Our experiments evaluate and compare adaptive thresholding method and normal thresholding method as for detection rate and false positive rate of sperm detection.
